# Uploaded movies and generated media.
# Do not ignore *.ts by extension: it also matches TypeScript (the Cloudflare
# Worker in services/media_gateway/). Keep HLS .ts segments inside the folders
# listed below. These paths are specific so that code folders such as
# lib/features/uploads/ and lib/data/ stay tracked.
/uploads/
/media/
/services/worker/uploads/
/services/worker/transcoding/
local-media/
tusd-data/
hls-output/
*.mp4
*.m4v
*.mkv
*.mov
*.avi
*.webm
*.wmv
*.flv
*.mpg
*.mpeg
*.m2ts
*.m3u8
*.m4s
*.mp3
*.aac
*.m4a
*.flac
*.wav
*.srt
*.vtt
ffmpeg2pass-*

# Logs, operating system and editor files
